## 🌐 Direction & Typography

* Direction: RTL (إجباري)
* Font: Tajawal

  * Weights: 400, 500, 700, 800

---

## 🎨 Colors (Tokens)

### Light

* --background: hsl(240 5% 96%)
* --foreground: hsl(240 10% 10%)
* --card: hsl(0 0% 100%)
* --primary: hsl(217 100% 50%)
* --secondary: hsl(240 4% 90%)
* --muted: hsl(240 4% 90%)
* --muted-foreground: hsl(240 5% 45%)
* --destructive: hsl(0 84% 60%)
* --border: hsl(240 6% 90%)
* --ring: hsl(217 100% 50%)

### Dark

* --background: hsl(0 0% 0%)
* --foreground: hsl(0 0% 98%)
* --card: hsl(240 5% 18%)
* --primary: hsl(217 100% 55%)
* --secondary: hsl(240 4% 24%)
* --muted: hsl(240 4% 24%)
* --muted-foreground: hsl(240 5% 75%)
* --destructive: hsl(0 100% 65%)
* --border: hsl(0 0% 100%)
* --ring: hsl(217 100% 55%)

---

## 📐 Spacing & Layout

* --radius: 1.5rem

* radius-lg: 1.5rem

* radius-md: calc(1.5rem - 2px)

* radius-sm: calc(1.5rem - 4px)

* spatial-card: 30px

* container padding: 2rem

* container max-width: 1400px

---

## 🧱 UI Rules (STRICT)

1. Cards:

   * Floating
   * Soft shadow
   * Depth effect

2. Layout:

   * Grid system
   * spacing من tokens

3. Buttons:

   * Primary / Secondary واضحين
   * حالات Hover / Active

4. Tables:

   * نظيفة
   * قراءة سهلة

5. Forms:

   * Labels واضحة
   * UX احترافي

---

## 🧠 UX Rules

* تقليل الخطوات

